  "finishedAt": null,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "4e92b8ce-c748-46ca-ba11-825bdee28877",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Hi Anna! I'm the Discovery Agent. Together we'll find a piece of recurring work in your week that is worth mapping, and map it step by step; it takes about 15–20 minutes. You don't need a process in mind, we'll find one by talking through your week. You can add a document (a procedure, a process map, an example report) at any time; I'll read it and you confirm what I found. The tool maps processes, not people: it never reports anyone's individual time. The transformation team may read this conversation to improve the tool. To start: Which department are you in?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:00+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "735acc0e-cb5d-42d0-bfdb-7b114c836f36",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "I work in Finance.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:01+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "40dcda34-f6bf-489e-b013-58f9f67c07fb",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:01+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "a2721908-4ebf-4b1c-98b6-ba81d84aed9f",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "I am a cost controller.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:02+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "9bd89793-50ce-4ee1-a60e-26d7e4db780d",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:02+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "5aef2d09-fb96-4e69-a017-e3fa5e95ee2b",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "Europe.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:03+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "d487d867-0226-4353-b1a0-67e69024022b",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:03+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc5f7804-8d2c-4171-80ea-c8116248450f",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "The monthly cost review. We also onboard suppliers, but that is another story.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:04+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "38753e42-5867-4201-a5a2-50ac4fd7d955",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:04+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "3e787169-0c10-40e9-9f67-d028a80d497d",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "It starts when the month-end close is done in the ledger.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:05+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "5bebb453-d639-4f0e-b34e-f921a4ed5e63",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:05+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "bbee128f-1c76-4b9d-82cd-a1f69d295ef0",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "At the end there is the monthly cost report, and the CFO uses it.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:06+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "4b5be73a-ec2b-4877-95a1-0237149718cc",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:06+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "2308d286-71cb-4d00-8681-dde31ca84b31",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "Once a month; the Head of Controlling owns it; it takes about 4 days.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:07+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "831b178f-2443-4bad-ba26-a6eee8a9e969",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:07+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ac92da6-f3bc-4635-b235-0ac911f0447d",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "We want 2 days. It is the same every month.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:08+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "d75f71d7-13a2-4d5d-8ee0-5028a41efc4f",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:08+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "30de1c37-5af9-43b1-beea-a12f8d5145d2",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "Same everywhere; no personal data.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:09+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3f22e3d-74b9-4bd7-a7e8-7941eb9f6c59",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:09+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "d14d35a3-e33f-4c56-85fe-83912e2ccb57",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "Two steps.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:10+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "2c0e32aa-017c-418e-b17c-b92c45c44b50",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:10+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "5dac32b8-33f9-4285-9f61-4a2b22c3b725",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "First we export and check the actuals.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:11+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "d86f0503-32af-4e79-941d-da10d85cdd31",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:11+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "badb35cf-ce39-4ca7-9a34-dfa66dcce035",
      "role": "expert",
      "text": "Then we write and send the report.",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:12+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "204d45d1-1131-42ce-8456-849874fc0854",
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Could you tell me more?",
      "at": "2026-11-19T10:00:12+00:00"
    }
